&_nc_oc=AdrF3zZwnGyR1rKBso5htlJlONJfaDDEHb4GVx2DcoeAMpNWFskNTiKej8RXEVlQ2Sk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIb6LCwGOZ139JlDiSIYlSZue_Gc5nOE9QQOB1MkZ-klA&oe=6AA80FBE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yK3VQMiovAgQ7kNvwHoSIZj&_nc_oc=Adrh2j1iCjyr1ST6bfS3vln5jBmr2vmNfkZ4tOsxUnaMSCcWyIz6vrOIQHsbDGhTEyo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL7eEOigTDVerxysZjho334x924eU5K_t83UJ8o5QbPkQ&oe=6AA7E87C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vsTqGHu3p2UQ7kNvwFIBYQ4&_nc_oc=AdpQj5zRkjv7dlJLLaC_BJtl2mtGYBsEQy3UK9PHV-BwVZbkHoACucCA-oxo4giGCZI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJwjuE0eemoUgzcRfCPeazFazQxh-3uF1ZiM1DM3RrHog&oe=6AA80707"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e8XtzmdVdd8Q7kNvwHkWmi_&_nc_oc=Adqu76V1ZThS4SfThVcuFANejMCIfg6mYt_rL8tLxdkin5IBJemMYU3My2n7XZzLZ_4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIlGwqAOSLkw0NlWkv07K07BVy1uv6u3iZlUo_Gj12DIg&oe=6AA7F2D5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2IfzOGjkVMsQ7kNvwGTPNhB&_nc_oc=AdqpXHuG5Uow1CREkvA9k7WFBwy1ozfjjt6KCFpcfQc_CO3Kwp6hy0MEAl_SlAtcF1c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI118Xk_UCISiLHrp1edqTRQeVccXIlITMFJQoTEQUXkg&oe=6AA7FF64"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.